Wrong (A): The actual filing date of February 15, 2026, does not start the limitations period because Section 6501(b)(1) treats early-filed returns as filed on the due date.
Wrong (B): January 1, 2026, the beginning of the tax year, has no relevance to when the statute of limitations begins running.
